## Destructive actions

> Three severity levels. Define what qualifies for each and what the UI does.

| Severity | Criteria | UI pattern |
|---|---|---|
| Low — easily undoable | << e.g. dismissing a draft, reordering items >> | << undo toast? instant? >> |
| Medium — consequential, recoverable | << e.g. deleting a saved record >> | << confirmation dialog? >> |
| High — irreversible | << e.g. permanent data loss, financial action >> | << explicit typed confirmation? >> |

**What text goes in the confirmation?**
<< Template for medium severity: "…" Confirm button label: "…" Cancel label: "…" >>

