## Empty states

**When a list or table has no data:**
<< What does the UI show? Illustration? Headline? Description? CTA? Be specific about copy pattern. >>

**When a search or filter returns no results:**
<< Same pattern or different? Is the "no results" copy distinct from "no data yet"? >>

**When an error prevents data from loading:**
<< What does the UI show? Retry button? Support link? Error code shown to user? >>

