## Focus and keyboard

**Tab order rule:**
<< How is tab order determined? DOM order? Explicit tabindex? Policy for modals / overlays? >>

**Focus trap rule:**
<< When is focus trapped? (modals, drawers) How is it released? >>

**Visible focus indicator:**
<< Describe the project's focus ring style. Is it the browser default? A custom style? >>

**Keyboard shortcut policy:**
<< Does this product define global keyboard shortcuts? Where are they documented? >>

**Skip-to-content link:**
<< Does the product have one? Where does it link? Required at this project's accessibility baseline? >>
